  "kind": "synthetic_closed_circulation_candidate",
  "limitations": [
    "Aggregate need groups; not 100 million individual actors",
    "Accounting flows alone do not prove physical delivery, price formation or sufficiency",
    "Physical production and capital replacement need separate coupled constraints",
    "Growth is in quantity at unchanged unit measure; extra opening reserve is prepositioned, not issued at a shock",
    "Delayed payments reside in explicit transit accounts; pooled cases keep bridging reserves in the common treasury, not personal accounts",
    "Transfer failures preserve balances but miss scheduled deadlines; no automatic retry policy",
    "Need weights are synthetic; additional contribution rewards and changing individual choice are not resolved"
  ],
